that's not an oratab file you're looking at, it's your etc/inittab file. 
the initial default isn't set there, however, it's set at the console 
level before you ever come up into single-user mode. run shutdown, go to 
console, and look at your 'boot*' parameters. one of them sets the 
default boot level, and that's what's probably bringing you up to 
single-user mode. 

cindy 

