Guy Finney wrote:
> 
> I thought this would be easy, but apparently I was wrong.  I'm trying
> to add an external JAZ drive to my au433 running 4.0c. It's SCSI ID is
> 3.
> 
> Apparently 'disklabel' doesn't approve of it, or else I'm
> misunderstanding something (hopefully the latter).  The command:
>         disklabel -wrn rz19 jaz
> gives the error "jaz: unknown disk type". I don't know where it came
