need for us to upgrade.
Now the DEC service checked a crash dump, found the "out-of-date OS version" 
and urged us to upgrade to 3.2g, then the problem "might" be solved.

Has anyone encountered the same problem and how was your solution?

Rainer Viehoefer
Systems Librarian
University Library
Oldenburg, Germany



