different machines, too?  That just complicates things.  You know, while we're at
it, why have different names?  Let's all make ours the same.  What should we pick -
Bill or Andy?

(Please take that as light-hearted humor, not flame :)

The morale of the story - some are better than others.  Who're you going to tell to
get rid of theirs?
