> 
> Ken Jones
> kbo@intersolve.com

Attachment 1: ls -alu /dev  on OSF/1 3.2 214 (3.2C)

You don't need to mknod explicitely most of the device specials.
Just use the MAKEDEV script (Attachment 2):

# cd /dev
# ./MAKEDEV std  # this will generate most of the basic specials
# ./MAKEDEV PTY_1 # pseudo terminals
# ./MAKEDEV rzxx  # (the disks...) 

Hope this helps.

